B.Ts=new A.a5("Morton's neuroma most commonly affects which intermetatarsal space?",B.LC,2,"Morton's neuroma most commonly affects the third-fourth intermetatarsal space (between the 3rd and 4th metatarsal heads). It involves the interdigital nerve and presents with burning pain, numbness in adjacent toes, and a positive Mulder's click test.")
