B.V3=new A.a5("A stress fracture of the second metatarsal is also known as a:",B.LM,1,'A "march fracture" is a stress fracture of the second (or third) metatarsal shaft, classically seen in military recruits during basic training. A Jones fracture is at the base of the 5th metatarsal. A dancer\'s fracture is a spiral fracture of the 5th metatarsal shaft.')
