B.Ur=new A.a5("Olecranon bursitis is characterized by swelling at which location?",B.Of,2,'The olecranon bursa lies superficially over the posterior tip of the olecranon process. Bursitis causes visible swelling at this site ("student\'s elbow" or "miner\'s elbow"). It can be traumatic, infectious (septic), or due to gout/RA. Always aspirate if infection is suspected.')
B.Mv=s(["Lateral epicondyle fracture, UCL tear, radial head fracture","Elbow dislocation, radial head fracture, coronoid process fracture","Olecranon fracture, UCL tear, radial nerve injury","Supracondylar fracture, radial head fracture, ulnar nerve injury"],t.s)
