B.Uo=new A.a5("A patient with decisional capacity voluntarily asks their physician to make treatment decisions on their behalf. Which of the following best describes this situation?",B.P4,1,"Autonomy includes the right to delegate decision-making. If a patient voluntarily and with understanding chooses to have someone else decide, that delegation itself is an exercise of autonomy, not a violation of it.")
