B.V8=new A.a5("A stroke patient demonstrates neglect of the left side, anosognosia, and impaired spatial awareness. The lesion is most likely in which hemisphere?",B.KD,1,"Left-sided neglect, anosognosia (denial of deficit), and impaired spatial awareness are classic findings of right (non-dominant) hemisphere strokes. Left hemisphere strokes more commonly produce aphasia. Neglect is a significant predictor of poorer rehabilitation outcomes.")
