B.Pc=s(["Zone of coagulation","Zone of stasis","Zone of hyperemia","Zone of necrosis"],t.s)
B.Tu=new A.a5("Which zone in Jackson's burn wound model represents the primary target for acute burn management and can potentially be salvaged with proper resuscitation?",B.Pc,1,'The zone of stasis is the critical "battleground" \u2014 tissue is ischemic but cells are still alive. With proper fluid resuscitation, oxygenation, and infection control, this zone can recover. If management fails, it converts to the zone of coagulation (necrosis).')
