B.Ve=new A.a5("Locked-in syndrome is caused by a lesion in which structure?",B.Lu,1,"Locked-in syndrome results from a ventral pontine lesion (typically basilar artery occlusion). The patient is fully conscious but quadriplegic and mute, retaining only vertical eye movements and blinking. Cognition is completely intact.")
