B.U0=new A.a5("According to the ARIC study data, what is the approximate mortality rate at 1 year post-stroke?",B.OO,1,"Per the ARIC (Atherosclerosis Risk in Communities) study: 30-day mortality is ~10.5%, 1-year is ~21.2%, 5-year is ~40%, and 24-year is ~58.4%. Board examiners frequently test this timeline.")
