B.U4=new A.a5("The dramatic 46% decline in stroke mortality from the 1950s to the 1970s is most strongly correlated with which development?",B.P1,1,"The massive decline in stroke mortality from the 1950s-1970s correlates directly with the introduction of effective antihypertensive medications. Controlling blood pressure was the single greatest factor in reducing stroke deaths during this period.")
